WEBVTT

00:00:05.480 --> 00:00:08.070
I've known since the first time I met you.

00:00:08.780 --> 00:00:13.950
I'm the only one who can make you happy, Ibuki-san.

00:00:15.280 --> 00:00:17.530
Daddy, where are you?

00:00:19.200 --> 00:00:21.080
Mommy...

00:00:21.080 --> 00:00:24.210
Ayame... Chihaya...

00:00:25.120 --> 00:00:26.710
Samurai-san...

00:00:36.280 --> 00:00:41.580
It doesn't matter when

00:00:41.680 --> 00:00:47.010
I always think of your smile

00:00:47.140 --> 00:00:52.480
The single word that I couldn't say

00:00:52.520 --> 00:00:57.680
I've always wanted to say it to you

00:00:57.450 --> 00:01:01.160
I pray so that our hearts may be connected

00:01:01.020 --> 00:01:03.900
But I couldn't see through the clouds

00:01:03.740 --> 00:01:08.650
In front of you, I swear that

00:01:08.500 --> 00:01:11.510
I will always be your side

00:01:11.220 --> 00:01:18.390
The future we anticipate is still far away

00:01:18.350 --> 00:01:21.950
You say that it's at the end of the world

00:01:21.970 --> 00:01:27.620
As long as I have a reason to shed tears

00:01:27.470 --> 00:01:32.480
I will not stop moving towards it

00:01:32.280 --> 00:01:42.410
As usual, we'll be together today

00:01:38.360 --> 00:01:42.410
kyou mo tonari ni iru

00:01:43.860 --> 00:01:47.860
In the same world

00:01:57.720 --> 00:02:02.930
Twelfth Longsword

00:01:58.680 --> 00:02:02.930
Yoichi, the Next Day!

00:02:09.650 --> 00:02:11.730
That's the Saginomiya residence.

00:02:11.730 --> 00:02:14.150
For a bunch of rich folks, they sure have awful taste.

00:02:15.360 --> 00:02:17.200
There's no bridge.

00:02:17.200 --> 00:02:18.450
How do we go across?

00:02:19.860 --> 00:02:21.780
I'll make a raft.

00:02:22.030 --> 00:02:23.530
Please wait.

00:02:26.080 --> 00:02:27.580
Ibuki-oneechan...

00:02:28.620 --> 00:02:30.380
Hey, Samurai.

00:02:30.920 --> 00:02:33.840
I think it's better for Chihaya and Kagome to stay here.

00:02:35.300 --> 00:02:37.840
We don't know what we'll come across,

00:02:38.300 --> 00:02:41.340
and I don't want them to get hurt.

00:02:41.340 --> 00:02:44.850
Dream on if you want to be alone with him.

00:02:44.850 --> 00:02:47.480
Th-That's not what I meant!

00:02:47.480 --> 00:02:52.520
If you don't know what will happen, you will need someone intelligent.

00:02:52.520 --> 00:02:57.400
Just one trap would wipe out both you and Yoichi-san.

00:02:57.400 --> 00:02:58.780
Well, excuse me!

00:02:58.780 --> 00:03:00.070
I...

00:03:02.490 --> 00:03:03.910
I want to go too.

00:03:04.370 --> 00:03:06.490
I want to save Ibuki-oneechan.

00:03:08.660 --> 00:03:11.120
We all feel the same.

00:03:11.120 --> 00:03:12.460
Let's go together!

00:03:13.540 --> 00:03:15.210
Give me a break...

00:03:17.170 --> 00:03:20.220
Ukiha Divine Wind Style, Fourth Technique:

00:03:20.220 --> 00:03:21.050
Tempest!

00:03:34.440 --> 00:03:35.520
Karasuma?

00:03:35.940 --> 00:03:39.400
Yes, and he's with the Ikaruga's sisters.

00:03:39.400 --> 00:03:41.070
How persistent...

00:03:41.070 --> 00:03:43.660
What's the point of coming?

00:03:43.660 --> 00:03:46.370
What should we do, Onii-sama?

00:03:46.370 --> 00:03:47.790
Chase them away.

00:03:47.790 --> 00:03:51.040
We don't need trouble on this memorable day.

00:03:52.790 --> 00:03:54.000
Stop standing around!

00:03:54.000 --> 00:03:54.880
Hurry up and go.

00:03:56.000 --> 00:03:58.130
You're so unromantic.

00:03:58.130 --> 00:04:04.140
Now that I've finally got my hands on Ibuki-san, won't you allow us to spend some time together alone?

00:04:04.970 --> 00:04:08.510
Yes, I'm sorry.

00:04:08.510 --> 00:04:11.520
Please excuse me, Onii-sama.

00:04:15.150 --> 00:04:18.690
This place is huge now that I see it up close.

00:04:18.690 --> 00:04:21.860
I wonder where Ibuki-oneechan is...

00:04:21.860 --> 00:04:23.950
That doesn't matter.

00:04:23.950 --> 00:04:26.740
We just need to find her and get her out of here.

00:04:28.160 --> 00:04:28.910
Excuse us.

00:04:29.740 --> 00:04:32.000
It's huge inside...

00:04:32.500 --> 00:04:34.540
This place would be a pain to clean.

00:04:35.080 --> 00:04:37.790
My, my, you're all together.

00:04:39.000 --> 00:04:39.920
Sakon-dono!

00:04:40.340 --> 00:04:47.010
I would welcome you, but my brother and Ibuki-san are getting married today.

00:04:47.640 --> 00:04:49.930
Could you come back some other time?

00:04:50.140 --> 00:04:51.770
Quit messing around!

00:04:51.770 --> 00:04:54.520
Stop toying around with my sister!

00:04:54.520 --> 00:04:56.940
We'll be taking Ibuki-nee back.

00:04:57.310 --> 00:05:00.020
My, my, how rude.

00:05:00.020 --> 00:05:03.440
I guess I have no need to hold back, then.

00:05:06.070 --> 00:05:08.660
Teach them a lesson for me.

00:05:08.950 --> 00:05:10.990
Yes, Milady!

00:05:24.510 --> 00:05:27.300
You won't lay a single hand on these folks.

00:05:27.760 --> 00:05:28.720
Samurai...

00:05:30.050 --> 00:05:31.760
You're truly amazing...

00:05:33.220 --> 00:05:35.980
...but I think you've forgotten my specialty.

00:05:38.100 --> 00:05:42.020
You're all below me; thus, you have nowhere to run.

00:05:43.190 --> 00:05:44.650
I will not run.

00:05:44.650 --> 00:05:46.700
You're just making things easier for me.

00:05:46.700 --> 00:05:49.700
Ukiha Divine Wind Style, First Technique:

00:05:49.700 --> 00:05:50.580
Hurricane!

00:05:55.580 --> 00:05:57.620
Nice, Yoichi-san!

00:05:58.460 --> 00:05:59.580
Let go of me!

00:06:02.090 --> 00:06:07.050
Sakon-dono, we just want you to return Ibuki-dono.

00:06:08.340 --> 00:06:10.760
You're also someone's sister...

00:06:10.760 --> 00:06:15.980
Try imagining how you would feel if your brother was suddenly taken away from you.

00:06:23.440 --> 00:06:26.990
Please allow me to see Ukyou-dono.

00:06:33.700 --> 00:06:34.870
Sakon-dono?

00:06:36.620 --> 00:06:39.580
My brother was taken away from me long ago.

00:06:42.380 --> 00:06:46.260
If you really want Ibuki-san back, give it your best.

00:06:49.260 --> 00:06:50.550
Then you leave me no choice.

00:06:54.180 --> 00:06:56.060
My dear guests...

00:06:56.890 --> 00:07:01.480
Unauthorized persons are not allowed to enter today.

00:07:01.480 --> 00:07:03.560
Please head back.

00:07:04.070 --> 00:07:05.940
There's no way we'll turn back!

00:07:05.940 --> 00:07:07.570
Hurry up and give back my sister!

00:07:07.850 --> 00:07:11.570
That goes against our master's orders.

00:07:12.490 --> 00:07:13.570
Who are those people?!

00:07:13.570 --> 00:07:16.910
Please head back... Please head back... Please head back...

00:07:17.750 --> 00:07:18.660
Samurai!

00:07:19.000 --> 00:07:21.790
Ukiha Divine Wind Style, Fifth Technique:

00:07:21.790 --> 00:07:22.670
Lull!

00:07:24.460 --> 00:07:25.380
There's more!

00:07:25.380 --> 00:07:26.460
Eighth Technique:

00:07:26.460 --> 00:07:28.130
Whirlwind!

00:07:30.380 --> 00:07:31.680
Nice going.

00:07:31.880 --> 00:07:35.220
Please head back... Please head back... Please head back...

00:07:35.970 --> 00:07:38.680
Ukiha Divine Wind Style, Sixth Technique:

00:07:38.680 --> 00:07:39.480
Winter Wind!

00:07:48.190 --> 00:07:50.530
Chihaya-oneechan...

00:07:50.530 --> 00:07:53.200
A manga artist has to do what she has to.

00:07:54.530 --> 00:07:55.320
This is bad...

00:07:55.320 --> 00:07:57.700
Although they're weak, there's just too many of them.

00:07:57.700 --> 00:07:58.620
Please head back...

00:07:58.620 --> 00:08:00.160
We'll lose eventually.

00:08:01.460 --> 00:08:02.710
Ayame-dono!

00:08:03.830 --> 00:08:05.040
Samurai!

00:08:06.540 --> 00:08:14.590
Please head back... Please head back... Please head back...

00:08:14.590 --> 00:08:15.550
Crap...

00:08:16.180 --> 00:08:18.890
I have to save everyone...

00:08:18.890 --> 00:08:19.970
Samurai!

00:08:19.970 --> 00:08:22.060
Yoichi-oniichan!

00:08:23.560 --> 00:08:26.060
Sakon-sama, what should we do now?

00:08:26.060 --> 00:08:27.690
Get rid of them.

00:08:27.690 --> 00:08:28.940
All of them.

00:08:28.940 --> 00:08:30.110
Understood.

00:08:32.900 --> 00:08:34.110
Pardon me.

00:08:35.530 --> 00:08:37.240
Eat this!

00:08:39.620 --> 00:08:40.540
Good-for-nothing?

00:08:40.540 --> 00:08:42.330
Who are you calling a good-for-nothing?

00:08:46.830 --> 00:08:48.380
Tsubame Flowing Style...

00:08:49.420 --> 00:08:50.420
We're here to help.

00:08:50.960 --> 00:08:52.170
Tsubasa-dono!

00:08:52.170 --> 00:08:53.670
Why are you guys here?

00:08:53.670 --> 00:08:55.380
Torigaya told us about this.

00:08:55.380 --> 00:08:57.930
I contacted Kei-chan beforehand.

00:08:58.430 --> 00:09:00.890
Just watch me, you shitty samurai.

00:09:00.890 --> 00:09:03.560
I'll be the one saving Ikaruga-san.

00:09:03.560 --> 00:09:06.190
And I'll be helping him.

00:09:07.020 --> 00:09:09.400
Tsubasa-dono! Washizu-dono!

00:09:10.570 --> 00:09:14.450
What can a delinquent and a traitor do?

00:09:14.450 --> 00:09:15.530
Take them down.

00:09:15.530 --> 00:09:17.410
The reward is as much as you want.

00:09:20.450 --> 00:09:21.740
This isn't looking good...

00:09:21.740 --> 00:09:23.910
Wassan!

00:09:23.910 --> 00:09:24.540
Torigaya?

00:09:25.040 --> 00:09:26.540
Catch!

00:09:27.460 --> 00:09:29.340
All right!

00:09:30.800 --> 00:09:32.250
Thanks, Torigaya!

00:09:33.300 --> 00:09:34.970
Wassan!

00:09:35.930 --> 00:09:38.890
You're Torigaya... right?

00:09:38.890 --> 00:09:41.470
What are you talking about, Wassan?

00:09:41.470 --> 00:09:42.310
Whatever!

00:09:46.310 --> 00:09:49.060
I'm sorry for coming late, Tsubasa-sama.

00:09:49.060 --> 00:09:50.820
Angie, thank goodness.

00:09:50.820 --> 00:09:53.030
I feel a lot stronger with you here!

00:10:15.550 --> 00:10:16.670
Tsubasa-sama!

00:10:19.010 --> 00:10:20.260
Beautiful.

00:10:20.760 --> 00:10:22.760
Goodness, what are they doing?

00:10:24.350 --> 00:10:25.600
There they are again.

00:10:25.600 --> 00:10:26.980
There's no end to this...

00:10:27.350 --> 00:10:28.770
Everyone, move forward!

00:10:30.150 --> 00:10:32.440
Oh no, you won't.

00:10:44.370 --> 00:10:46.870
This place won't last long. You guys come too!

00:10:47.330 --> 00:10:49.210
R-Right!

00:10:50.750 --> 00:10:55.000
Wassan, go on without me!

00:10:50.750 --> 00:10:51.750
Torigaya!

00:10:56.670 --> 00:10:58.220
Damn it...

00:10:58.220 --> 00:10:59.470
Washizu-dono!

00:11:00.430 --> 00:11:03.390
Shitty samurai, I'll leave Ikaruga-san to you.

00:11:05.260 --> 00:11:06.470
Tsubasa-sama!

00:11:09.100 --> 00:11:12.190
Let go of him!

00:11:13.980 --> 00:11:15.360
Washizu-dono...

00:11:15.360 --> 00:11:16.820
He's just a good-for-nothing.

00:11:18.490 --> 00:11:19.570
Hold on tight.

00:11:20.490 --> 00:11:21.780
I'm sorry, Wassan.

00:11:21.780 --> 00:11:25.120
When you came here to save Ikaruga-san...

00:11:25.450 --> 00:11:29.120
Shut up, watch me catch up after I take care of these guys.

00:11:29.120 --> 00:11:30.920
I haven't given up yet!

00:11:31.250 --> 00:11:32.040
Watch out!

00:11:32.790 --> 00:11:33.670
Thanks.

00:11:34.250 --> 00:11:35.000
No problem.

00:11:36.420 --> 00:11:39.010
There's no need to rush...

00:11:39.010 --> 00:11:43.010
As long as we have her, our Tsubame Flowing Style will definitely...

00:11:43.010 --> 00:11:44.010
Tsubasa-sama!

00:11:44.260 --> 00:11:45.010
Angie?

00:11:45.680 --> 00:11:46.640
Sorry!

00:11:57.650 --> 00:12:00.190
The day of our style's revival is near.

00:12:02.780 --> 00:12:05.870
But... just how many enemies are there?

00:12:12.160 --> 00:12:13.040
Over there?

00:12:13.040 --> 00:12:14.080
Hold it.

00:12:14.080 --> 00:12:16.630
What now? We don't have time!

00:12:19.590 --> 00:12:22.170
That way is a dead end.

00:12:22.170 --> 00:12:24.890
They used some sort of illusion to tun this place into a maze.

00:12:25.140 --> 00:12:27.050
What? Seriously?

00:12:27.050 --> 00:12:29.810
The paths are all weird...

00:12:29.810 --> 00:12:31.980
I think that way is fastest!

00:12:31.980 --> 00:12:33.390
Nice one.

00:12:34.060 --> 00:12:35.690
I'm a manga artist, after all.

00:12:44.780 --> 00:12:46.240
On that day,

00:12:47.200 --> 00:12:50.240
I visited your dojo with my father,

00:12:50.580 --> 00:12:53.540
and I fell in love with you at first sight.

00:12:54.290 --> 00:12:58.040
In terms of martial arts, you were far stronger than me.

00:12:58.460 --> 00:12:59.670
This is no good...

00:12:59.670 --> 00:13:01.670
I'm weaker than the person I love.

00:13:01.670 --> 00:13:04.130
I can't confess or propose to her...

00:13:04.630 --> 00:13:09.140
Ibuki-san, I'll train and become stronger!

00:13:09.140 --> 00:13:12.020
Once I've achieved that, can we meet again?

00:13:12.730 --> 00:13:15.560
Then will you...

00:13:16.440 --> 00:13:18.020
Okay, I'll wait for you!

00:13:21.360 --> 00:13:26.280
I've become strong in martial arts as well as other things.

00:13:26.280 --> 00:13:29.450
When I thought I could finally be together with you...

00:13:30.830 --> 00:13:32.160
Karasuma Yoichi got in my way.

00:13:34.160 --> 00:13:36.210
But everything is all right now.

00:13:36.210 --> 00:13:39.540
From now on, I'll make you happy.

00:13:42.000 --> 00:13:42.960
Let's begin!

00:13:44.800 --> 00:13:46.050
Onii-sama...

00:13:46.050 --> 00:13:47.720
This isn't the time to be doing something like this...

00:13:48.430 --> 00:13:49.680
What the hell do you mean by "something like this"?!

00:13:51.100 --> 00:13:55.480
You're against our marriage?!

00:13:55.480 --> 00:14:00.190
Of course not, but Karasuma and the others are coming this way...

00:14:00.190 --> 00:14:02.650
Wouldn't it be better to change locations?

00:14:02.650 --> 00:14:04.360
You didn't get rid of them?!

00:14:04.360 --> 00:14:05.400
You useless fool!

00:14:06.780 --> 00:14:08.160
Whatever.

00:14:08.160 --> 00:14:13.660
I'll get rid of Karasuma myself if he shows up.

00:14:13.660 --> 00:14:16.960
I won't let anyone interfere.

00:14:20.920 --> 00:14:22.380
Now, let us be together—

00:14:22.380 --> 00:14:25.380
Ukiha Divine Wind Style, Third Technique:

00:14:25.380 --> 00:14:26.760
Falcon!

00:14:31.180 --> 00:14:32.390
Karasuma Yoichi!

00:14:35.020 --> 00:14:36.810
Saginomiya Ukyou-dono,

00:14:37.480 --> 00:14:39.190
please return Ibuki-dono to us.

00:14:39.690 --> 00:14:41.110
Samurai-san!

00:14:41.110 --> 00:14:43.480
You never learn, do you?

00:14:43.480 --> 00:14:45.360
How many times do I have to tell you?

00:14:45.360 --> 00:14:48.400
You'll never be able to make Ibuki-san happy!

00:14:48.950 --> 00:14:50.740
However, I'm different.

00:14:50.740 --> 00:14:55.740
I can give Ibuki-san anything and everything in this world.

00:14:55.740 --> 00:14:59.420
She'll only be happy if she's with me!

00:14:59.960 --> 00:15:04.550
From the beginning, I never thought I could make Ibuki-dono happy.

00:15:06.340 --> 00:15:10.380
The only people who can make her happy are her family.

00:15:10.380 --> 00:15:14.260
That is, Ayame-dono, Chihaya-dono and Kagome-dono.

00:15:14.930 --> 00:15:19.690
And to that end, it's my duty to support and protect these four!

00:15:19.690 --> 00:15:22.150
I know this even with my lack of experience!

00:15:23.560 --> 00:15:24.980
Anything?

00:15:24.980 --> 00:15:26.530
Everything in this world?

00:15:26.530 --> 00:15:29.900
The most important thing is missing from your feelings!

00:15:29.900 --> 00:15:33.070
How could anyone be happy without their family?!

00:15:34.320 --> 00:15:35.160
Sis!

00:15:35.160 --> 00:15:36.370
Ibuki-nee!

00:15:36.370 --> 00:15:37.830
Ibuki-oneechan!

00:15:39.580 --> 00:15:43.210
Ayame... Chihaya...

00:15:47.340 --> 00:15:47.920
Sakon.

00:15:49.840 --> 00:15:50.840
Sakon!

00:15:50.840 --> 00:15:51.970
Yes!

00:15:51.970 --> 00:15:52.930
I'll leave them to you.

00:16:02.480 --> 00:16:04.560
You cannot pass.

00:16:04.560 --> 00:16:08.320
Even if you take Ibuki-san back, she'll be like that forever.

00:16:08.320 --> 00:16:10.280
She'll never get her memories back.

00:16:11.530 --> 00:16:14.820
I won't ever make an antidote

00:16:14.820 --> 00:16:18.580
because my brother is happiest when he's with Ibuki-san.

00:16:19.200 --> 00:16:22.040
Why are you crying?

00:16:24.170 --> 00:16:28.340
You've also realized that Ukyou-dono is wrong, have you not?

00:16:29.880 --> 00:16:32.170
It's the same in manga.

00:16:32.170 --> 00:16:37.180
You'll never obtain happiness if you lie to yourself.

00:16:39.640 --> 00:16:40.970
Karasuma...

00:16:41.600 --> 00:16:43.140
Please...

00:16:44.270 --> 00:16:45.650
Understood.

00:16:51.110 --> 00:16:52.690
You guys take the stairs.

00:16:52.690 --> 00:16:54.320
What about you?

00:16:57.160 --> 00:16:58.330
Is he a monkey?

00:16:59.330 --> 00:17:00.410
There's no other choice.

00:17:00.410 --> 00:17:02.080
We'll have the ceremony somewhere else.

00:17:06.120 --> 00:17:08.380
What the hell is Sakon doing?

00:17:11.670 --> 00:17:12.710
Ibuki-dono!

00:17:12.920 --> 00:17:14.590
Karasuma!

00:17:15.300 --> 00:17:17.890
Ukiha Divine Wind Style, Eighth Technique:

00:17:17.890 --> 00:17:19.140
Whirlwind!

00:17:26.270 --> 00:17:27.440
Saginomiya!

00:17:29.150 --> 00:17:32.690
You let wealth take over you, and you treated your sister as a tool.

00:17:32.690 --> 00:17:34.360
Now, where do you think you're going?!

00:17:34.820 --> 00:17:36.890
If you're still a martial artist,

00:17:37.740 --> 00:17:39.240
then speak with your martial arts!

00:17:48.880 --> 00:17:49.960
I see...

00:17:50.840 --> 00:17:52.050
You're right.

00:17:55.630 --> 00:17:57.800
Your words have enlightened me.

00:17:59.050 --> 00:18:00.680
Thank you, Karasuma.

00:18:03.060 --> 00:18:05.020
As you wish, I'll show you.

00:18:05.520 --> 00:18:07.230
This is my strength!

00:18:09.190 --> 00:18:12.110
Saginomiya Sapphire Style, Special Fan Technique:

00:18:12.110 --> 00:18:13.730
Dragon Flash!

00:18:16.530 --> 00:18:18.160
How was it, Karasuma?

00:18:18.160 --> 00:18:20.280
This is my skill with the fan.

00:18:21.200 --> 00:18:22.410
Intriguing!

00:18:23.700 --> 00:18:25.870
This is how a showdown should be.

00:18:26.330 --> 00:18:27.960
Wouldn't you say, Saginomiya-dono?

00:18:29.830 --> 00:18:33.750
If so, can you block this wind?!

00:18:34.590 --> 00:18:38.180
Ukiha Divine Wind Style, Second Technique:

00:18:38.180 --> 00:18:40.220
Blizzard!

00:18:46.220 --> 00:18:48.520
You're too strong...

00:18:49.100 --> 00:18:52.730
Just how much have you trained?

00:18:52.730 --> 00:18:54.570
You're good.

00:18:54.570 --> 00:18:57.490
That move was harder to handle than money or assassins.

00:19:02.910 --> 00:19:05.040
Ukyou-kun?

00:19:05.620 --> 00:19:06.620
Her memories...

00:19:06.620 --> 00:19:07.620
Ibuki-dono?

00:19:10.250 --> 00:19:11.630
Sis!

00:19:12.130 --> 00:19:13.630
Ibuki-nee!

00:19:20.760 --> 00:19:22.970
Ibuki-oneechan!

00:19:23.760 --> 00:19:24.890
Kagome!

00:19:25.850 --> 00:19:26.850
Ibuki-san!

00:19:28.020 --> 00:19:29.350
No!

00:19:37.570 --> 00:19:38.820
Wassan!

00:19:38.820 --> 00:19:40.070
Ikaruga-san!

00:19:46.740 --> 00:19:49.370
Ukiha Divine Wind Style, Seventh Technique:

00:19:49.370 --> 00:19:50.830
Tornado!

00:19:59.420 --> 00:20:00.300
They're safe!

00:20:00.300 --> 00:20:01.340
All right!

00:20:01.340 --> 00:20:02.550
Thank goodness!

00:20:02.550 --> 00:20:05.140
That shitty samurai sure scared us.

00:20:10.850 --> 00:20:12.640
I thought we were going to die...

00:20:12.640 --> 00:20:14.730
I've found some good manga material.

00:20:15.690 --> 00:20:18.320
I forgot that I can't swim!

00:20:20.320 --> 00:20:21.820
Yoichi-san...

00:20:22.200 --> 00:20:23.320
You're disgusting!

00:20:23.610 --> 00:20:27.330
Ibuki-dono, you're finally back!

00:20:27.950 --> 00:20:29.830
Ibuki-oneechan,

00:20:30.660 --> 00:20:32.330
it broke...

00:20:33.250 --> 00:20:35.330
We can fix it together,

00:20:35.710 --> 00:20:36.880
as many times as it takes.

00:20:37.420 --> 00:20:38.130
Yeah!

00:20:56.400 --> 00:20:59.860
Dear Father,

00:21:01.150 --> 00:21:03.360
How are you doing?

00:21:04.240 --> 00:21:06.530
Please forgive my selfishness,

00:21:06.530 --> 00:21:10.370
but I'd like to stay here for training a bit longer.

00:21:11.290 --> 00:21:14.370
This is embarrassing to say, but the reason is that I have yet to learn anything.

00:21:15.790 --> 00:21:22.380
The situation with Ukyou-dono was just a misunderstanding, but it made me realize a lot of things.

00:21:22.920 --> 00:21:27.010
Training isn't just about improving your body and your skills.

00:21:28.260 --> 00:21:32.970
There are things that can be learned from everyday life.

00:21:32.970 --> 00:21:40.520
Sign: Washizu Vision?

00:21:34.270 --> 00:21:37.520
I finally understand what you meant, Father.

00:21:38.230 --> 00:21:40.520
I'll be starting over from scratch.

00:21:41.190 --> 00:21:45.530
Thankfully, the Ikaruga family have accepted my request to stay.

00:21:45.530 --> 00:21:48.950
I won't be coming back any time soon, so please forgive me.

00:21:49.410 --> 00:21:50.330
Oh, right!

00:21:50.330 --> 00:21:54.960
There will be a research presentation from the cultural club at school next week.

00:21:55.660 --> 00:22:00.250
I'll be participating in it, so I'll give you the details later.

00:22:01.090 --> 00:22:04.090
Yoichi... Yoichi...

00:22:06.340 --> 00:22:07.630
Ridiculous!

00:22:21.360 --> 00:22:28.360
I thought I knew which path I wanted to follow,

00:22:28.910 --> 00:22:35.910
but there are nights on which I lose sight of the path.

00:22:36.540 --> 00:22:43.170
If I mumble to myself, saying that I can't keep going,

00:22:44.090 --> 00:22:50.930
will you scold at me and show me that I'm wrong?

00:22:50.930 --> 00:22:52.800
You lit a fire in my heart,

00:22:52.800 --> 00:22:56.600
giving me the strength to continue to believe.

00:22:56.600 --> 00:23:00.400
I'll continue my journey with my head held high,

00:23:00.400 --> 00:23:02.310
for this is my journey and mine alone!

00:23:02.310 --> 00:23:07.490
I'll start with the easy things.

00:23:07.490 --> 00:23:11.280
I'll make my prayers full of hope,

00:23:11.280 --> 00:23:15.290
for all of my prayers will support me through the present.

00:23:15.290 --> 00:23:22.580
I hope that you will come with me, as you are my support.

00:23:22.580 --> 00:23:26.340
As I familiarize myself with my newfound path,

00:23:26.340 --> 00:23:29.880
I am certain that you will give me courage.

00:23:29.880 --> 00:23:37.640
You will help me go beyond where the ray of sunlight directs.
